    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/677e6657c7dd86fa576785231c073b65.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/677e6657c7dd86fa576785231c073b65.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/677e6657c7dd86fa576785231c073b65.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f3e56e07b3d3f62d8fe9b571967a39f0.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just 10 minutes per run! A casual roguelite RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Auto-Battle&quot; x &quot;Gear Swapping&quot; x &quot;Roguelite&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is automatic\u2014just change out weapons and outfits to build your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each 10-minute run changes based on routes and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/06fb93cdb54f403ef9a45be01b25165c.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/06fb93cdb54f403ef9a45be01b25165c.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/06fb93cdb54f403ef9a45be01b25165c.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A nostalgic 2D RPG charm, reimagined in 3D with a fresh yet familiar feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made for those grown-up players who once dreamed of adventures like these.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/aebecd337e6200e7a7f598f68f6b38cc.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/aebecd337e6200e7a7f598f68f6b38cc.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/aebecd337e6200e7a7f598f68f6b38cc.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/36f4a31aec2a8b5a257cf571883447b8.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One summer day, a mysterious creature\u2014Mogmo\u2014appears in a quiet countryside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three children set off on a journey to find where Mogmo truly belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with new friends, they cross forests and deserts in a small yet grand adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And what is the place Mogmo is meant to return to\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/74fb21d3fdc727922f12dcbacfd737fd.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/74fb21d3fdc727922f12dcbacfd737fd.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/74fb21d3fdc727922f12dcbacfd737fd.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mogmo has a special ability: it can eat gear to combine skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on how you feed it, you can create a one-of-a-kind skill set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/b8707f69e1ebd4b4efed2bd770dc229d.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/b8707f69e1ebd4b4efed2bd770dc229d.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/b8707f69e1ebd4b4efed2bd770dc229d.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/0fd94212c2b7cdca7ed96095bf2c8b6d.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game alternates between &quot;Town Phase&quot; and &quot;Adventure Phase.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In town, you can explore freely, enjoy the story, and interact with the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/8d9647b3df93d8bd00d5ce93803b7eb7.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/8d9647b3df93d8bd00d5ce93803b7eb7.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/8d9647b3df93d8bd00d5ce93803b7eb7.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3042\u3042\u3042</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/c610d2fd22a0a2ee1da419cd37a54abc.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;Adventure Phase&quot; features auto battles as you journey toward the next town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f13f0da1bcd52bb5c220df81a2db079b.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f13f0da1bcd52bb5c220df81a2db079b.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f13f0da1bcd52bb5c220df81a2db079b.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear found in battle can be swapped instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the combinations, unique combo actions emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/86a221adf5bfb18d357d74d84b583584.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/86a221adf5bfb18d357d74d84b583584.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/86a221adf5bfb18d357d74d84b583584.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing gear also changes your look, letting you enjoy styles that match your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/e2d3f551e0cef8444b7417402440c757.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/e2d3f551e0cef8444b7417402440c757.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/e2d3f551e0cef8444b7417402440c757.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/677e6657c7dd86fa576785231c073b65.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/677e6657c7dd86fa576785231c073b65.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/677e6657c7dd86fa576785231c073b65.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f3e56e07b3d3f62d8fe9b571967a39f0.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just 10 minutes per run! A casual roguelite RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Auto-Battle&quot; x &quot;Gear Swapping&quot; x &quot;Roguelite&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is automatic\u2014just change out weapons and outfits to build your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each 10-minute run changes based on routes and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/06fb93cdb54f403ef9a45be01b25165c.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/06fb93cdb54f403ef9a45be01b25165c.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/06fb93cdb54f403ef9a45be01b25165c.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A nostalgic 2D RPG charm, reimagined in 3D with a fresh yet familiar feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made for those grown-up players who once dreamed of adventures like these.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/aebecd337e6200e7a7f598f68f6b38cc.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/aebecd337e6200e7a7f598f68f6b38cc.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/aebecd337e6200e7a7f598f68f6b38cc.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/36f4a31aec2a8b5a257cf571883447b8.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One summer day, a mysterious creature\u2014Mogmo\u2014appears in a quiet countryside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three children set off on a journey to find where Mogmo truly belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with new friends, they cross forests and deserts in a small yet grand adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And what is the place Mogmo is meant to return to\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/74fb21d3fdc727922f12dcbacfd737fd.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/74fb21d3fdc727922f12dcbacfd737fd.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/74fb21d3fdc727922f12dcbacfd737fd.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mogmo has a special ability: it can eat gear to combine skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on how you feed it, you can create a one-of-a-kind skill set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/b8707f69e1ebd4b4efed2bd770dc229d.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/b8707f69e1ebd4b4efed2bd770dc229d.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/b8707f69e1ebd4b4efed2bd770dc229d.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/0fd94212c2b7cdca7ed96095bf2c8b6d.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game alternates between &quot;Town Phase&quot; and &quot;Adventure Phase.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In town, you can explore freely, enjoy the story, and interact with the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/8d9647b3df93d8bd00d5ce93803b7eb7.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/8d9647b3df93d8bd00d5ce93803b7eb7.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/8d9647b3df93d8bd00d5ce93803b7eb7.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3042\u3042\u3042</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/c610d2fd22a0a2ee1da419cd37a54abc.avif?t=1752593929\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;Adventure Phase&quot; features auto battles as you journey toward the next town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f13f0da1bcd52bb5c220df81a2db079b.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f13f0da1bcd52bb5c220df81a2db079b.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/f13f0da1bcd52bb5c220df81a2db079b.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear found in battle can be swapped instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the combinations, unique combo actions emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/86a221adf5bfb18d357d74d84b583584.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/86a221adf5bfb18d357d74d84b583584.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/86a221adf5bfb18d357d74d84b583584.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing gear also changes your look, letting you enjoy styles that match your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/e2d3f551e0cef8444b7417402440c757.poster.avif?t=1752593929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/e2d3f551e0cef8444b7417402440c757.webm?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/e2d3f551e0cef8444b7417402440c757.mp4?t=1752593929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
